  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6.2b">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAs">IV As</ref> 6.2b</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif hine hwa licge binnan ðæm fyrste, þonne gebete ge ðæs mundbyrde ðe he ær sohte, oþþe he hine twelfa sum ladige, þæt he þa socne nyste.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone slays him within that period of respite, he shall pay as compensation the mundbyrd of him to whom the thief has fled to clear himself [by asseverating] with the support of eleven others that he was not aware that the privilege of sanctuary had been obtained.</ab>
      </div>
